1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,891
Threadline. Enterprise Gen AI and agentic AI.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,736
Trusted knowledge. Governed actions. Better decisions.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,903
Admins control the knowledge foundation and platform oversight.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,757
Upload a verified document, define its audience, and index it locally.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,074
Teams work from shared knowledge with controlled access.

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:30,286
Managers turn authorized information into decision support.

7
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,485
An Operations manager checks the leadership reserve.

8
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,525
Retrieval brings back the permitted policy, with a citation to the original evidence.

9
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:48,168
Generate a source-backed briefing to support planning and review.

10
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,661
The report can be downloaded and shared.

11
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:00,815
Employees get a workspace for everyday knowledge and requests.

12
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,972
Ask about annual leave.

13
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:09,490
RAG retrieves the policy and returns twenty-five working days.

14
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:13,847
Open the citation to verify the original passage.

15
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,978
Employees can check the evidence before acting.

16
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:24,347
The same leadership question now returns insufficient evidence.

17
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:28,710
Restricted documents stay outside the employee's knowledge scope.

18
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,397
Now request workspace access.

19
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:37,933
The agent selects a tool, records its steps, and pauses for human approval.

20
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,577
Work continues through a saved workflow.

21
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:49,583
An administrator reviews the exact request and records the decision.

22
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:54,411
Approval creates an access-review ticket.

23
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:59,461
It does not grant access or change the employee's role.

24
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:07,669
Back in the saved conversation, the employee sees the completed workflow.

25
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:11,002
The ticket moves to In Progress.

26
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:18,487
Administrators monitor activity, response time, outcomes, and audit events.

27
00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:24,025
Automated evaluations compare answers with expected evidence.

28
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:26,903
Human review remains a separate requirement.

29
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,909
Prompt versions make changes traceable.

30
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:37,381
Explore adoption, operating cost, and expected business value.

31
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:41,062
These are planning estimates, not measured savings.

32
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:47,453
Threadline. Enterprise knowledge, governed automation, and decision support.

33
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,352
Built with local AI.
